      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. One more thing to add for the slide—could you touch on the complexity aspect? Maintaining multiple instances is definitely more work than just one big server. How would you describe the operational overhead or the 'messiness' that comes with managing all these different moving parts? I want to show that we've thought about the trade-offs.",
